                         Free List Download  V1.0
                         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

                                 TYPE: AIM

 PURPOSE:
 ~~~~~~~~
   - This DOOR Allows you to Free Download the File List on a conference
     It has been tested on /X 3.20-31 and works fine. I have not tested
     it on /X 2.x

   - You can choose between theese commands at the prompt.

     1) Lha --> To compress the list using LHA Archive
     2) Zip --> To Compress the list using Zip Archive
     3) TXT --> to have the file like it is normally shown to you

   - CallersLog Will be updated if a user succesfully used this Util
   
   - If a User will choose to use the TXT only Option a line with your
     BBS' Name + the Date and Time of the day of Download will be added


 REQUIREMENTS:
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~
   - Ami Express 3.20+
     I don't know if it works with Ami Express 1.1x ( But who cares! )


 INSTALLATION:
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~
   - Copy the LSD_Tools Directory to your DOORS: dir
   - Copy the directory Commands in your BBS:Commands directory
                        ¯                ¯¯¯¯¯

 /X 3.20+

   - Copy the file bbs:commands/BBSCmd/g.info in to your bbs:commands/BBSCmd/
     directory.
 
   Or make a new one filling it using the following:

        ACCESS=001
	LOCATION=DOORS:LSD_Utils/G.Rexx
	MULTINODE=YES
	PRIORITY=0
	STACK=50000
	TYPE=XIM
 
 USAGE:
 ~~~~~~
 
   - Just type the DLG on the main menu 

